{"level":"info","ts":1738780851.402667,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/model.go:67","msg":"Sending message","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash-exp","id":"f7782bd0-b07e-4778-a2f1-5727038016ca","content":"Write the code to fix the following issue:\n\nIssue: 9\n\nTitle: Track PRs\n\nBody: Agent should track all pull requests with the label `dev-team`. If the pull request is closed, merged, or the label is removed, the pull request should no longer be tracked. \n\nIf a comment is added to a tracked pull request then a new commit should be added to the pull request that addresses the comment\n\n\n\nThe code should be written in the language of the repository.\nIt is recommended that you first list the files in the repository and read one of them to get an idea of the codebase.\nAfter that, make sure you use the writeFile tool to write the code to a file.\n\n"}
