{"level":"info","ts":1738781323.0881398,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/gemini.go:78","msg":"Handling text","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash-exp","id":"2e4f7289-7789-4dac-a1ab-0d2406451e54","content":"I have implemented the missing functions in `pkg/github/github.go`.\n\nHere's a summary of all the changes:\n\n*   **Modified `internal/handlers/github.go`:**\n    *   Added `HandleGitHubWebhook` to handle webhook POST requests.\n    *   Implemented signature verification for security.\n    *   Parsed the webhook payload and determined the event type.\n    *   Implemented `handlePullRequestEvent` to track pull requests with the `dev-team` label.\n    *   Implemented `handleIssueCommentEvent` to add commits to the PR that address the comment.\n    *   Implemented `handleIssueEvent` to track labeled and unlabeled issues.\n*   **Updated `cmd/dev-team/main.go`:**\n    *   Registered the `/github/webhook` route and mapped it to `HandleGitHubWebhook`.\n*   **Added `TrackedPRs` to `internal/state/state.go`:**\n    *   Added a `TrackedPRs` map to the `AppState` struct to store the pull requests that are currently being tracked.\n*   **Implemented missing functions in `pkg/github/github.go`:**\n    *   `GetPullRequest` retrieves a pull request from GitHub using the GitHub API.\n    *   `WriteFileToRepo` writes a file to the repository.\n    *   `AddFileToRepo` adds a file to the repository.\n    *   `CommitChanges` commits the changes to the repository.\n    *   `PushChanges` pushes the changes to the remote repository.\n\nI believe this addresses the issue as described.\n"}
