ned (type *\"github.com/jbutlerdev/dev-team/internal/state\".AppState has no field or method TrackedPullRequests)`**: This indicates that the `TrackedPullRequests` field is not correctly defined in the `internal/state/state.go` file. I'll verify the field definition and ensure it's accessible.\n\nLet's start by reading the `cmd/dev-team/main.go` file to check the import path.\n\n"}
