{"level":"info","ts":1738784379.0392776,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/gemini.go:78","msg":"Handling text","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash-exp","id":"3e9135bd-a44b-47df-8439-6853c783528a","content":"Now I will address the import cycle issue.\n\nThe `internal/config` package is imported by `internal/state`, and `internal/state` is imported by `internal/config`. To break this cycle, I will remove the import of `internal/config` from `internal/state`. Instead of directly accessing the settings from the `internal/state` package, I will pass the necessary configuration values as arguments to the functions that need them.\n\n"}
{"level":"info","ts":1738784379.039295,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/gemini.go:57","msg":"Handling function call","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash-exp","id":"3e9135bd-a44b-47df-8439-6853c783528a","name":"writeFile","content":"{writeFile map[basePath:/data/jbutler/tmpgit/jbutlerdev/dev-team content:package state\n\nimport (\n\t\"sync\"\n\n\t\"github.com/jbutlerdev/dev-team/pkg/repository\"\n)\n\n// State holds the application's state.\ntype StateData struct {\n\tRepositories map[string]*repository.Repository\n\tGitHubToken string\n\tMu           sync.RWMutex\n\tTrackedPullRequests map[int]bool // Map of pull request IDs to a boolean indicating if they are tracked\n}\n\n// State is the global application state.\nvar State = &StateData{\n\tRepositories: make(map[string]*repository.Repository),\n\tGitHubToken:     \"\",\n\tTrackedPullRequests: make(map[int]bool),\n}\n\nfunc (s *StateData) TrackPullRequest(pullRequestID int) {\n\ts.TrackedPullRequests[pullRequestID] = true\n}\n\nfunc (s *StateData) UntrackPullRequest(pullRequestID int) {\n\tdelete(s.TrackedPullRequests, pullRequestID)\n}\n\n// IsPullRequestTracked returns true if the pull request is being tracked.\nfunc (s *StateData) IsPullRequestTracked(pullRequestID int) bool {\n\t_, tracked := s.TrackedPullRequests[pullRequestID]\n\treturn tracked\n}\n\nfunc (s *StateData) SetGitHubToken(token string) {\n\ts.Mu.Lock()\n\tdefer s.Mu.Unlock()\n\ts.GitHubToken = token\n}\n path:/internal/state/state.go]}"}
