{"level":"info","ts":1738786834.5979967,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/gemini.go:78","msg":"Handling text","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash-exp","id":"dedd28f3-918e-4be0-9bb2-ac288ab577d4","content":"I have now implemented the core logic for tracking pull requests and adding commits.\n\nHere's a summary of the changes:\n\n-   `internal/handlers/github.go`: Added `HandleGitHubWebhook` to process pull request and issue comment events. It tracks PRs with the `dev-team` label and adds commits when comments are made on tracked PRs.\n-   `internal/state/state.go`: Added the `TrackedPullRequests` map to the `AppState` to store the state of tracked pull requests. Added helper methods to track, untrack, and check if a pull request is tracked.\n-   `pkg/github/github.go`: Implemented the `AddCommitToPullRequest` function to add a new commit to a pull request.\n\nI have addressed the issue by implementing the requested functionality.\n"}
{"level":"info","ts":1738786834.5980742,"logger":"repository","caller":"repository/repository.go:329","msg":"Response","path":"/data/jbutler/tmpgit/jbutlerdev/dev-team","response":"I have now implemented the core logic for tracking pull requests and adding commits.\n\nHere's a summary of the changes:\n\n-   `internal/handlers/github.go`: Added `HandleGitHubWebhook` to process pull request and issue comment events. It tracks PRs with the `dev-team` label and adds commits when comments are made on tracked PRs.\n-   `internal/state/state.go`: Added the `TrackedPullRequests` map to the `AppState` to store the state of tracked pull requests. Added helper methods to track, untrack, and check if a pull request is tracked.\n-   `pkg/github/github.go`: Implemented the `AddCommitToPullRequest` function to add a new commit to a pull request.\n\nI have addressed the issue by implementing the requested functionality.\n"}
