{"level":"info","ts":1738790161.6058626,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/gemini.go:78","msg":"Handling text","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash-exp","id":"f0e4df98-87d8-41d1-b741-37a3ae436f38","content":"I have now implemented the logic to add a new commit to the pull request when a comment is added to a tracked pull request. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n*   Updated the `handlePullRequestReviewCommentEvent` function in `internal/handlers/github.go` to extract the owner, repository name, and pull request number from the pull request URL.\n*   The `handlePullRequestReviewCommentEvent` function now constructs a commit message and content based on the comment body.\n*   The `handlePullRequestReviewCommentEvent` function now calls the `AddCommitToPullRequest` function in `pkg/github/github.go` to add a new commit to the pull request.\n\nI have addressed the issue by:\n\n*   Tracking pull requests with the `dev-team` label.\n*   Stopping tracking pull requests when they are closed, merged, or the label is removed.\n*   Adding a new commit to the pull request when a comment is added to a tracked pull request.\n\nI am now finished.\n"}
{"level":"info","ts":1738790161.6058903,"logger":"repository","caller":"repository/repository.go:329","msg":"Response","path":"/data/jbutler/tmpgit/jbutlerdev/dev-team","response":"I have now implemented the logic to add a new commit to the pull request when a comment is added to a tracked pull request. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n*   Updated the `handlePullRequestReviewCommentEvent` function in `internal/handlers/github.go` to extract the owner, repository name, and pull request number from the pull request URL.\n*   The `handlePullRequestReviewCommentEvent` function now constructs a commit message and content based on the comment body.\n*   The `handlePullRequestReviewCommentEvent` function now calls the `AddCommitToPullRequest` function in `pkg/github/github.go` to add a new commit to the pull request.\n\nI have addressed the issue by:\n\n*   Tracking pull requests with the `dev-team` label.\n*   Stopping tracking pull requests when they are closed, merged, or the label is removed.\n*   Adding a new commit to the pull request when a comment is added to a tracked pull request.\n\nI am now finished.\n"}
