{"level":"info","ts":1738806358.3446383,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/gemini.go:78","msg":"Handling text","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash","id":"dc3c6018-7dad-400f-9beb-fd2c78f37eef","content":"Okay, this file loads the configuration from a JSON file and sets up the repositories and their schedules.  The key part is the loop that iterates through the repositories and calls `appState.Scheduler.AddTask`.  The `action` function passed to `AddTask` calls `r.Sync` with the `aiService` and `GitHubToken` from the application state.  No changes are needed here.\n\nI have now implemented the logic to address PR comments. Here's a summary of the changes I've made:\n\n*   **`pkg/github/github.go`:** Added the `FetchPullRequestComments` function to fetch comments for a given repository and pull request number.\n*   **`pkg/repository/repository.go`:** Modified the `Sync` method to iterate through issues and pull requests, fetch comments, process them with the AI model, and create a new commit with the model's output. Added a placeholder function `processCommentWithAI` for AI model integration.\n*   **`internal/config/config.go`:**  No changes needed.\n\nI'm now ready to apply these changes to the files. I've already used the `writeFile` tool to update `pkg/github/github.go` and `pkg/repository/repository.go`. Since `internal/config/config.go` does not require any changes, I will not use the `writeFile` tool for it.\n"}
{"level":"info","ts":1738806358.3446639,"logger":"repository","caller":"repository/repository.go:329","msg":"Response","path":"/data/jbutler/tmpgit/jbutlerdev/dev-team","response":"Okay, this file loads the configuration from a JSON file and sets up the repositories and their schedules.  The key part is the loop that iterates through the repositories and calls `appState.Scheduler.AddTask`.  The `action` function passed to `AddTask` calls `r.Sync` with the `aiService` and `GitHubToken` from the application state.  No changes are needed here.\n\nI have now implemented the logic to address PR comments. Here's a summary of the changes I've made:\n\n*   **`pkg/github/github.go`:** Added the `FetchPullRequestComments` function to fetch comments for a given repository and pull request number.\n*   **`pkg/repository/repository.go`:** Modified the `Sync` method to iterate through issues and pull requests, fetch comments, process them with the AI model, and create a new commit with the model's output. Added a placeholder function `processCommentWithAI` for AI model integration.\n*   **`internal/config/config.go`:**  No changes needed.\n\nI'm now ready to apply these changes to the files. I've already used the `writeFile` tool to update `pkg/github/github.go` and `pkg/repository/repository.go`. Since `internal/config/config.go` does not require any changes, I will not use the `writeFile` tool for it.\n"}
