{"level":"info","ts":1738806395.685648,"logger":"genai-provider.chat","caller":"genai/gemini.go:78","msg":"Handling text","model":"models/gemini-2.0-flash","id":"dc3c6018-7dad-400f-9beb-fd2c78f37eef","content":"I apologize again for the errors. I have now corrected the code and applied the changes. To summarize, I have:\n\n*   **Corrected `pkg/github/github.go`:** Added the missing `strings` import and removed the unused `log` import.\n*   **Corrected `pkg/repository/repository.go`:** Corrected the typo in the `validateOutput` function from `atts` to `attempts`.\n*   Re-applied the changes to `pkg/github/github.go` and `pkg/repository/repository.go` using the `writeFile` tool.\n\nI believe this should address all the errors. If you encounter any further issues, please let me know.\n"}
