{"level":"info","ts":1738806464.4310482,"logger":"repository","caller":"repository/repository.go:329","msg":"Response","path":"/data/jbutler/tmpgit/jbutlerdev/dev-team","response":"Okay, I see the problem. `cmd/dev-team/main.go` is using specific handler functions like `handlers.HandleListRepositories`, `handlers.HandleAddRepository`, etc.  These handlers were originally split between `internal/handlers/github.go` and `internal/handlers/repository.go`. Now that I've moved `HandleGitHubRepositories` and `HandleGitHubIssues` to `internal/handlers/github.go`, I need to make sure *all* the handler functions used in `cmd/dev-team/main.go` are available in the `internal/handlers` package.\n\nTo solve this, I will move the `HandleCreatePR` from `internal/handlers/repository.go` to `internal/handlers/github.go`.\n"}
